OL,3,ASpain PM pins hopes on housing crisis
OL,4,Ato help win snap election
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez's
OL,7,Fdecision to call a snap election for 29
OL,8,FNovember came on the back of a
OL,9,Fparliamentary defeat.
OL,11,FOn Friday, the raft of measures he had
OL,12,Fpresented to congress aimed at
OL,13,Fimproving conditions for tenants and
OL,14,Ftrying to address the problem of
OL,15,Fsoaring rentals was narrowly rejected,
OL,16,Fas parties on the right voted against
OL,17,Fthem.
OL,19,FThat parliamentary result confirmed
OL,20,Fthat Sanchez's left-wing coalition no
OL,21,Flonger commanded a majority.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
